   "text": "Veletaris Storm, Vanguard and Raider Sections may fill Troops slots, and gain Line (1) and Feel No Pain (6+). Seals and respirators leave no place for the clumsy: the army brings no Charonite Ogryn, no Aethon Heavy Sentinels and no Lord of War. At least two Veletaris Sections are required.",
